  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "One of my avatars has a toggle-able gun which defaults off and is activated via the expression menu.  When I uploaded it I didn't disable the game object in Unity, so when I spawned in it was attached to the T-pose until calibrated and then the animators kicked in and disabled it.  However it was only disabled locally, so everyone else could still see it, even after hopping to a different world.  Yes this was my fault for not setting my game object properly which has been fixed on the model but the sync issue should be looked into.",
